{
    "title": "BigFuture\u00ae School",
    "description": "BigFuture\u00ae School is a free mobile app for students 13 and over who take the digital PSAT/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or SAT School Day in the United States and provided their mobile phone number. To access the app, you'll need to use the mobile number you provided when you took your test. This account information is separate from your College Board account.\r\n\r\nWith this app, you can:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get your test scores easily on your phone\r\n\u2022 Connect with nonprofit colleges and scholarship programs through Connections \u2122 * that may be a good match for you\r\n\u2022 Get customized career information\r\n\u2022 Learn about how to plan and pay for college\r\n\r\nLearn more about BigFuture School and how to access it here: https://satsuite.collegeboard.org/bigfuture-school-mobile-app\r\n\r\n* If Connections is offered at your school",
    "descriptionHTML": "BigFuture\u00ae School is a free mobile app for students 13 and over who take the digital PSAT/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or SAT School Day in the United States and provided their mobile phone number. To access the app, you&#39;ll need to use the mobile number you provided when you took your test. This account information is separate from your College Board account.<br><br>With this app, you can:<br><br>\u2022 Get your test scores easily on your phone<br>\u2022 Connect with nonprofit colleges and scholarship programs through Connections \u2122 * that may be a good match for you<br>\u2022 Get customized career information<br>\u2022 Learn about how to plan and pay for college<br><br>Learn more about BigFuture School and how to access it here: https://satsuite.collegeboard.org/bigfuture-school-mobile-app<br><br>* If Connections is offered at your school",
